","surfaces":["勾芒"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-117-xiangru"],"status":"contextual_provisional","confidence_level":"high","identification_basis":{"kind":"source_named_legendary_entity_with_commentary","target_mention_ids":["c-shiji-117-xiangru:m052-0132"],"historical_event_attendance_not_inferred":true},"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru","source_id":"s-shiji117-xiangru","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:p052","quote":"邪絕少陽而登太陰兮，與真人乎相求。互折窈窕以右轉兮，橫厲飛泉以正東。悉徵靈圉而選之兮，部乘眾神於瑤光。使五帝先導兮，反太一而從陵陽。左玄冥而右含靁兮，前陸離而後潏湟。厮征北僑而役羡門兮，屬岐伯使尚方。祝融驚而蹕御兮，清氛氣而後行。屯余車其萬乘兮，綷雲蓋而樹華旗。使勾芒其將行兮，吾欲往乎南嬉。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-117-xiangru:m052-0132"]}],"references":[{"title":"《漢書》張揖釋句芒","url":"https://github.com/kanripo/KR2a0007/blob/683113d4baf6febecaf2ccb7913df87c4d68d454/KR2a0007_057.txt#L942-L943","quote":"(合五采雲以為葢/也綷音子内反)使句芒其將行兮吾欲徃乎南娭(張/揖)¶\n(曰句芒東方青帝之佐也鳥身人面乘両/龍師古曰將行將領從行也娭音許其反)歴唐堯於崇¶","source_commit":"683113d4baf6febecaf2ccb7913df87c4d68d454","source_blob":"44cd0a168123204ab8369c8382018dbaaa846a86","verified_extent":{"start_line":851,"end_line":980},"cached_response_sha256":"024b03fcdb819f2edf0c84f816d618653f6fdafa4b48e6c2c36ec8fbe2ce1210","image_verified":false}],"rationale":"本篇勾芒與漢書句芒各存，古注稱東方青帝之佐；不按造形補生平或親屬。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:p052","text":"邪絕少陽而登太陰兮，與真人乎相求。互折窈窕以右轉兮，橫厲飛泉以正東。悉徵靈圉而選之兮，部乘眾神於瑤光。使五帝先導兮，反太一而從陵陽。左玄冥而右含靁兮，前陸離而後潏湟。厮征北僑而役羡門兮，屬岐伯使尚方。祝融驚而蹕御兮，清氛氣而後行。屯余車其萬乘兮，綷雲蓋而樹華旗。使勾芒其將行兮，吾欲往乎南嬉。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m052-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"真人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m052-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"靈圉","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m052-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"眾神","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"i